      "Revolutionary Wars (1792-1802) created 'sister republics' across western Europe and spread revolutionary institutions.",
      "Ideological legacy: liberal constitutionalism, radical democracy, Burkean conservatism, nationalism, Romanticism — all defined themselves against the Revolution.",
