      "First IR (1780-1850): cotton, steam, iron, Britain dominant.",
      "Second IR (1870-1914): steel, chemicals, electricity, Germany/US lead.",
      "Population: 190M (1800) → 420M (1900); ~50% urban in industrial cores by 1900.",
      "Reorganized class, family, city, politics, and Europe's global relationships.",
